              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nko kwagha nyo le ropöwonto ngokï nyo, kïsis ompö ropöwcho kïpelöy chik nko ropöwo pagh nko ropöw cho kigheghöy.",
          "type": "text",
